     1,
     "<div>Hello everyone, I&#39;m struggling with kernel density plots.</div><div>I&#39; ve already achieved this with photographs, and due to problems with the videos, I decided to add them manually in the excel table generated by R with the metadata of the pictures that do work.</div><div>Using the exactly same format and according to the present values, I calculated the &quot;<b>deltatime</b>&quot; for each video record, and then this error appeared:</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(52,53,65);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(52,53,65);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">&gt; activityDensity(recordTable = SEMINARIO_MANUAL, species = geoffroy, xlab = &quot;Hora&quot;, ylab = &quot;Densidad&quot;)\r\nWarning message:\r\nGEOFFROY: Error in densityPlot(subset_species$Time.rad, main = paste(&quot;Activity of&quot;,  : \r\n <b> Bandwidth estimation failed.</b>\r\n    - SKIPPED </span>  <span style=\"color:rgb(52,53,65);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(52,53,65);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(52,53,65);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(52,53,65);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><u>The excel column format used:</u></span></div>Station\tSpecies\tDateTimeOriginal\tDate\tTime\t<b>delta.time.secs\tdelta.time.mins\tdelta.time.hours\tdelta.time.days</b>\tDirectory\tFileName\tn_images</span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(52,53,65);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></span></div><div>Is there any way to make it work, also making it possible to consider only the independent records for the graphs from this modified table?<span style=\"color:rgb(52,53,65);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></span></div><div><br></div><div>I really would appreciate some help please! Good night!</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>"
